 want to compromise on quality but Reynaldo Martin means we dont have to. Ladies check him out.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.reynaldomartin.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.reynaldomartin.com\/<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks for sharing HappilyEverAfter!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'll definitely check him out!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><3<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372257073,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.91.164.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76888,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dd4cb3c4e7b4036ae59b594e3f26674d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thanks for sharing ladies. going on their website now.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1859455,"PostDate":1405358620,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thanks for sharing ladies. going on their website now.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r