{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":10,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":1356,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1845169,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":277552,"Name":"soontobemrsrowe","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1397875561,"LastPoster":{"Id":282975,"Name":"SashJAbride","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":23,"Preview":{"Id":1895543,"PostDate":1430940734,"PostContent":"I'm getting married in August, and I'll be using Production Box: http:\/\/www.productionboxja.com\/....","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sashenie@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.98.248.131","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430758982,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"SashJAbride","Id":282975,"Name":"SashJAbride","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.252.175.115","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76888,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"81fe7485e627a1463ad4f03981fffac8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Has anyone heard about 876 Films?? It seems they&#039;re an affiliate of Elite Media Concepts who also does videography in Jamaica.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;They only have 1 video on their website which was shot at Iberostar Suites (that&#039;s actually where we&#039;ve decided to get married next year :D&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;\"&gt;)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Anyways I love their video and I&#039;m seriously considering them but I haven&#039;t heard anything about them on here.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Can anyone give me some additional info about them before I make a decision?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I copied the link for their video so you can take a look.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/876films.com\/?p=16&#039;&gt;http:\/\/876films.com\/?p=16&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I neeeed some guidance!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1845169,"PostDate":1397875561,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Has anyone heard about 876 Films?? It seems they're an affiliate of Elite Media Concepts who also does videography in Jamaica.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>They only have 1 video on their website which was shot at Iberostar Suites (that's actually where we've decided to get married next year <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px\">)<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Anyways I love their video and I'm seriously considering them but I haven't heard anything about them on here.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Can anyone give me some additional info about them before I make a decision?\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I copied the link for their video so you can take a look.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/876films.com\/?p=16' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/876films.com\/?p=16<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I neeeed some guidance!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rachelandstephen23@gmail.com","IpAddress":"72.252.175.115","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1397223450,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"soontobemrsrowe","Id":277552,"Name":"soontobemrsrowe","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.58.97.194","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76888,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"032eed191b0500acfd905491ea56a7c8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey soontobemrsrowe!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Sorry I haven&#039;t :(&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;But I&#039;m booking with Elite Media!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Did you get a quote from 876? I&#039;d love to know what they quoted you to see if there&#039;s a big difference in price compared to Elite.....&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n\t&amp;nbsp;","Attachments":[],"Id":1846256,"PostDate":1398449234,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey soontobemrsrowe!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Sorry I haven't <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>But I'm booking with Elite Media!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Did you get a quote from 876? I'd love to know what they quoted you to see if there's a big difference in price compared to Elite.....<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\t\u00a0\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372257073,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"95.145.62.28","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76888,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7a73a54dad6e7a3e36ec814eb3f1d754","RawContent":"[quote name=\"soontobemrsrowe\" post=\"1845169\" timestamp=\"1397871961\"]\nHas anyone heard about 876 Films?? It seems they&#039;re an affiliate of Elite Media Concepts who also does videography in Jamaica.\n\nThey only have 1 video on their website which was shot at Iberostar Suites (that&#039;s actually where we&#039;ve decided to get married next year :D[font=arial][size=3])[\/size][\/font]\n\nAnyways I love their video and I&#039;m seriously considering them but I haven&#039;t heard anything about them on here.\n\nCan anyone give me some additional info about them before I make a decision? \n\nI copied the link for their video so you can take a look.\n\n[url=\"http:\/\/876films.com\/?p=16\"]http:\/\/876films.com\/?p=16[\/url]\n\nI neeeed some guidance![\/quote]Hi,\n\nI saw them too and they have the same address and phone number as EMC. I think they are the same people. They have only 1 video on Vimeo that looks great. EMC are really pricey so we may go with Reynaldo Martin who is equally as talented and cheaper. I have looked around hard and dont want to compromise on quality but Reynaldo Martin means we dont have to. Ladies check him out.\n\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.reynaldomartin.com\/\"]http:\/\/www.reynaldomartin.com\/[\/url]","Attachments":[],"Id":1846809,"PostDate":1398602625,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>soontobemrsrowe, on 18 April 2014 - 06:46 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Has anyone heard about 876 Films?? It seems they're an affiliate of Elite Media Concepts who also does videography in Jamaica.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>They only have 1 video on their website which was shot at Iberostar Suites (that's actually where we've decided to get married next year <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px\">)<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Anyways I love their video and I'm seriously considering them but I haven't heard anything about them on here.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Can anyone give me some additional info about them before I make a decision?\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I copied the link for their video so you can take a look.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/876films.com\/?p=16' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/876films.com\/?p=16<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I neeeed some guidance!\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hi,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I saw them too and they have the same address and phone number as EMC. I think they are the same people. They have only 1 video on Vimeo that looks great. EMC are really pricey so we may go with Reynaldo Martin who is equally as talented and cheaper. I have looked around hard and dont want to compromise on quality but Reynaldo Martin means we dont have to. Ladies check him out.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.reynaldomartin.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.reynaldomartin.com\/<\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"divaexquisitehair@gmail.com","IpAddress":"96.43.173.75","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1390106334,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276188.jpg?_r=1399653269","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":122,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"HappilyEverAfter","Id":276188,"Name":"HappilyEverAfter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.58.97.194","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76888,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"45182ba55c308bf8b2a6013a11222bde","RawContent":"[quote name=\"HappilyEverAfter\" post=\"1846809\" timestamp=\"1398599025\"]\nHi,\n\nI saw them too and they have the same address and phone number as EMC. I think they are the same people. They have only 1 video on Vimeo that looks great. EMC are really pricey so we may go with Reynaldo Martin who is equally as talented and cheaper. I have looked around hard and dont want to compromise on quality but Reynaldo Martin means we dont have to. Ladies check him out.\n\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.reynaldomartin.com\/\"]http:\/\/www.reynaldomartin.com\/[\/url][\/quote]\nThanks for sharing HappilyEverAfter!\n\nI&#039;ll definitely check him out!\n\n&amp;lt;3","Attachments":[],"Id":1847008,"PostDate":1398701174,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>HappilyEverAfter, on 27 April 2014 - 04:43 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I saw them too and they have the same address and phone number as EMC. I think they are the same people. They have only 1 video on Vimeo that looks great. EMC are really pricey so we may go with Reynaldo Martin who is equally as talented and cheaper. I have looked around hard and dont want to compromise on quality but Reynaldo Martin means we dont have to. Ladies check him out.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.reynaldomartin.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.reynaldomartin.com\/<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks for sharing HappilyEverAfter!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'll definitely check him out!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><3<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372257073,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.91.164.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76888,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dd4cb3c4e7b4036ae59b594e3f26674d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thanks for sharing ladies. going on their website now.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1859455,"PostDate":1405358620,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thanks for sharing ladies. going on their website now.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"noeljennifer1@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"12.52.150.2","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403621919,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278674.jpg?_r=1405114043","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jennifernoel1","Id":278674,"Name":"jennifernoel1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"131.96.249.246","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76888,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bc3ea82bef6f8cf9eeb539876d208a6c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hmm let me check them out as well.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1859766,"PostDate":1405411935,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hmm let me check them out as well.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff8c00;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 AnnaTennille & Eric<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff8c00;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 May 16, 2015<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:#ff8c00;\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Montego Bay, Jamaica<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:#ff8c00;\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 <img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10765;484\/st\/20150516\/e\/The+Day+We+Say+I+Do%21\/k\/b124\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"a.johnson1013@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"99.108.237.58","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403202280,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278601.jpg?_r=1403203318","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"atennille","Id":278601,"Name":"atennille","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"205.241.31.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76888,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f8ed6e7ef6d8c0fce0245af79b2e3f4f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Ladies!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I will be using them for my April 25th wedding. I was told that they are the cheaper sister company of EMC. I&#039;m taking a chance, but they were referred to me by EMC, so I assume they&#039;re great! I will let you know how my video comes out :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1879162,"PostDate":1416962087,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Ladies!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I will be using them for my April 25th wedding. I was told that they are the cheaper sister company of EMC. I'm taking a chance, but they were referred to me by EMC, so I assume they're great! I will let you know how my video comes out <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shauna.phillipskelly@gmail.com","IpAddress":"205.241.31.2","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1389752825,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"skelly0386","Id":276089,"Name":"skelly0386","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.229.105.172","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76888,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5761f7387fb36ebc455e15d44316b85e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Did you end up using 876 Films? &amp;nbsp;If so, I would love to hear about your experience. &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m thinking of booking with them for my wedding this year.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895392,"PostDate":1430845747,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Did you end up using 876 Films? \u00a0If so, I would love to hear about your experience. \u00a0I'm thinking of booking with them for my wedding this year.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"joeandmaxine2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"142.229.105.172","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430845175,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Max906","Id":282982,"Name":"Max906","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"205.241.31.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76888,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9ada1b30e4e1f451e3aaf3de557f8f37","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Max906\"] I just used them for my wedding on April 25th. They were really nice and arrived on time. The only downside is that they told me it would take 6 months to receive my video. I don&#039;t know if that&#039;s normal, but I will let you know when I receive the video.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895424,"PostDate":1430855863,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282982\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282982-max906\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Max906<\/span><\/a> I just used them for my wedding on April 25th. They were really nice and arrived on time. The only downside is that they told me it would take 6 months to receive my video. I don't know if that's normal, but I will let you know when I receive the video.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shauna.phillipskelly@gmail.com","IpAddress":"205.241.31.2","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1389752825,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"skelly0386","Id":276089,"Name":"skelly0386","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.98.248.131","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76888,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d317541e71606bd4c6cfa45bfda29f22","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m getting married in August, and I&#039;ll be using Production Box: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.productionboxja.com\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.productionboxja.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;. Quality is solid, creativity is great, and their packages were more reasonable than others I checked out. They were also more responsive than most people, and even did a video call with me to make sure they had a sense of what I was looking for. I&#039;d highly recommend adding to the list of options to check out! &lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895543,"PostDate":1430940734,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm getting married in August, and I'll be using Production Box: <a href='http:\/\/www.productionboxja.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.productionboxja.com\/<\/a>. Quality is solid, creativity is great, and their packages were more reasonable than others I checked out. They were also more responsive than most people, and even did a video call with me to make sure they had a sense of what I was looking for. I'd highly recommend adding to the list of options to check out! <\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sashenie@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.98.248.131","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430758982,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"SashJAbride","Id":282975,"Name":"SashJAbride","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"76888","Title":"Has Anyone Heard About 876 Films In Jamaica?","LastPostDate":1430940734},"Pages":{"TotalItems":10,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
