Address":"108.184.186.20","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1396148555,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"CherJK","Id":277400,"Name":"CherJK","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.36.235.231","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ef473e9f6e32a2ca63dd03e434983d04","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Soon2beMrsJ\"].....I am so glad you made your decision.&amp;nbsp; I am going for a site visit to Royalton White Sands in June 9th.&amp;nbsp; I am going to Jamaica June 6 to 10th.&amp;nbsp; I can&#039;t decide between Secrets and Royalton.   I did a site visit with Secrets in Oct of last year but I am going to visit them again on June 6th.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Congrats on your decision!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1849121,"PostDate":1399606526,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276557\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/276557-soon2bemrsj\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Soon2beMrsJ<\/span><\/a>.....I am so glad you made your decision.\u00a0 I am going for a site visit to Royalton White Sands in June 9th.\u00a0 I am going to Jamaica June 6 to 10th.\u00a0 I can't decide between Secrets and Royalton.\u00a0\u00a0 I did a site visit with Secrets in Oct of last year but I am going to visit them again on June 6th.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congrats on your decision!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"letitia_leaks@verizon.net","IpAddress":"63.119.183.254","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1397070122,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277534.jpg?_r=1397086760","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsGlover","Id":277534,"Name":"FutureMrsGlover","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.126.17.167","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"33ffa5561e26ffbe43387502ad625891","RawContent":"[quote name=\"CherJK\" post=\"1849112\" timestamp=\"1399601783\"]\n@[member=\"Soon2beMrsJ\"], I am getting married at the White Sands a few weeks before you! Could you send me the pictures you took? I do not have the necessary post count to view them. My email is cherylk1234@[member=\"gmail\"].com.[\/quote]\nSure!  I&#039;ll email them to you now.  So fun that we&#039;re getting married in the same month!! \n[quote name=\"FutureMrsGlover\" post=\"1849121\" timestamp=\"1399602926\"]\n@[member=\"Soon2beMrsJ\"].....I am so glad you made your decision.  I am going for a site visit to Royalton White Sands in June 9th.  I am going to Jamaica June 6 to 10th.  I can&#039;t decide between Secrets and Royalton.   I did a site visit with Secrets in Oct of last year but I am going to visit them again on June 6th. \n\nCongrats on your decision![\/quote]\nThanks!!  Both resorts are so beautiful so I can understand why it&#039;s hard to choose between them. Good luck with your decision!! Can&#039;t wait to hear what you pick  :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1849122,"PostDate":1399606868,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>CherJK, on 08 May 2014 - 07:16 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276557\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/276557-soon2bemrsj\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Soon2beMrsJ<\/span><\/a>, I am getting married at the White Sands a few weeks before you! Could you send me the pictures you took? I do not have the necessary post count to view them. My email is cherylk1234@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Sure! \u00a0I'll email them to you now. \u00a0So fun that we're getting married in the same month!!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>FutureMrsGlover, on 08 May 2014 - 07:35 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276557\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/276557-soon2bemrsj\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Soon2beMrsJ<\/span><\/a>.....I am so glad you made your decision.\u00a0 I am going for a site visit to Royalton White Sands in June 9th.\u00a0 I am going to Jamaica June 6 to 10th.\u00a0 I can't decide between Secrets and Royalton.\u00a0\u00a0 I did a site visit with Secrets in Oct of last year but I am going to visit them again on June 6th.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congrats on your decision!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!! \u00a0Both resorts are so beautiful so I can understand why it's hard to choose between them. Good luck with your decision!! Can't wait to hear what you pick \u00a0<img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jgugenheim@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391807727,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276557.jpg?_r=1433950078","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2beMrsJ","Id":276557,"Name":"Soon2beMrsJ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.243.36.191","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9bf5158878a1055d3b648e4ff6e6e11f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;That&#039;s great news. &amp;nbsp;Its really good you got to do a few site visits! &amp;nbsp;Happy Planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1849125,"PostDate":1399607048,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>That's great news. \u00a0Its really good you got to do a few site visits! \u00a0Happy Planning!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"liannabanana@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.243.36.191","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1393125652,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276829.jpg?_r=1397589644","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":162,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LiannaBanana","Id":276829,"Name":"LiannaBanana","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.126.17.167","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by Soon2beMrsJ, 08 May 2014 - 07:55 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1399607742,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e0005023461102bff1fe81923f9ce5aa","RawContent":"[quote name=\"LiannaBanana\" post=\"1849125\" timestamp=\"1399603448\"]\nThat&#039;s great news.  Its really good you got to do a few site visits!  Happy Planning![\/quote]\nThanks!! Yes, we were lucky to be able to see places in person. We stayed at the Riu Montego Bay so we were able to see a few of their weddings and drove to the Royalton for 2  hours. We stayed at Secrets Wild Orchid a year and a half ago. All amazing resorts!","Attachments":[],"Id":1849128,"PostDate":1399607657,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>LiannaBanana, on 08 May 2014 - 07:44 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>\nThat's great news.  Its really good you got to do a few site visits!  Happy Planning!<\/p><\/div><\/div><br>\nThanks!! Yes, we were lucky to be able to see places in person. We stayed at the Riu Montego Bay so we were able to see a few of their weddings and drove to the Royalton for 2  hours. We stayed at Secrets Wild Orchid a year and a half ago. All amazing resorts!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jgugenheim@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391807727,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276557.jpg?_r=1433950078","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2beMrsJ","Id":276557,"Name":"Soon2beMrsJ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5d71b2df80e35cd0e08e7ff2db547dd8","RawContent":"Yay!! So happy for you!! \n\n\nPam ;)","Attachments":[],"Id":1849135,"PostDate":1399609882,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\