{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"47.54.40.212","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b6ed6b3a65f3f3abe87634273e34d9d9","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Soon2beMrsJ\" post=\"1849092\" timestamp=\"1399598443\"]\nAfter a TON of research and a few site visits, my fiance and I have finally chosen the Royalton White Sands for our April 25, 2015 wedding!!!  We&#039;re so excited to have the resort picked so we can start the planning and our guests can start figuring out their travel plans.\n \nWe visited the resort on May 3rd and met with Chandlyn, who showed us every spot on the resort. She was awesome and answered every question we had. The resort is amazing!!!! It is beyond beautiful and the people who work there are great as well.\n \nI attached a few photos for the brides who wanted to see \"real\" pics!! \n \nHappy Planning!!\n \n[img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=27815\"]view from upstairs walkway.JPG[\/url]\n \n[img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=27816\"]pool.JPG[\/url]\n \n[img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=27817\"]room.JPG[\/url]\n \n[img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=27818\"]island off the beach.JPG[\/url]\n \n[img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=27819\"]water sports.jpg[\/url]\n \n[img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=27820\"]view from the gazebo.JPG[\/url]\n \n[img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=27821\"]wedding gazebo.JPG[\/url][\/quote]\nCongratulations!! I have also booked the Royalton White Sands. Wedding date set for  January 10th, 2015!! Could you send me the pictures if you don&#039;t mind? Falontubman@hotmail.com. Thank you very much.","Attachments":[],"Id":1849222,"PostDate":1399659433,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Soon2beMrsJ, on 08 May 2014 - 06:20 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>After a TON of research and a few site visits, my fiance and I have finally chosen the Royalton White Sands for our April 25, 2015 wedding!!! \u00a0We're so excited to have the resort picked so we can start the planning and our guests can start figuring out their travel plans.<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nWe visited the resort on May 3rd and met with Chandlyn, who showed us every spot on the resort. She was awesome and answered every question we had. The resort is amazing!!!! It is beyond beautiful and the people who work there are great as well.<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nI attached a few photos for the brides who wanted to see \"real\" pics!!\u00a0<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nHappy Planning!!<br>\n\u00a0<br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=27815' class='bbc_url' title=''>view from upstairs walkway.JPG<\/a><br>\n\u00a0<br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=27816' class='bbc_url' title=''>pool.JPG<\/a><br>\n\u00a0<br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=27817' class='bbc_url' title=''>room.JPG<\/a><br>\n\u00a0<br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=27818' class='bbc_url' title=''>island off the beach.JPG<\/a><br>\n\u00a0<br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=27819' class='bbc_url' title=''>water sports.jpg<\/a><br>\n\u00a0<br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=27820' class='bbc_url' title=''>view from the gazebo.JPG<\/a><br>\n\u00a0<br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=27821' class='bbc_url' title=''>wedding gazebo.JPG<\/a><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br><br>\nCongratulations!! I have also booked the Royalton White Sands. Wedding date set for  January 10th, 2015!! Could you send me the pictures if you don't mind? Falontubman@hotmail.com. Thank you very much. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"falontubman@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"47.54.40.212","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1399385976,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277857.jpg?_r=1399384355","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bridetobe771","Id":277857,"Name":"Bridetobe771","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"32de24fe8e5bc7e1e7112c0169a4feef","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thank you and congratulations to you as well!!&amp;nbsp; Happy to email the pics&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1849228,"PostDate":1399659972,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thank you and congratulations to you as well!!\u00a0 Happy to email the pics\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jgugenheim@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391807727,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276557.jpg?_r=1433950078","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2beMrsJ","Id":276557,"Name":"Soon2beMrsJ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.58.97.194","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditRea