  'title' => 'Accidentally bought my dress but I love it',
  'postContent' => 'They say dont ever go to bridal shop and try on dresses until you are ready to buy one because most likely you will end up liking the one you tried on.  I went to this Toronto Designer warehouse sale just to checked it as they are advertising thousands of designer dresses at really good steal. The warehouse sale is only for 3 days so I decided to go and voila... ..  I bought my dress which will sleep in my closet until April 2017 :) .  Im not worried about changing my mind coz this dress is exactly how I imagine to be wearing on my wedding day. ',
