;","Attachments":[],"Id":1865829,"PostDate":1407852393,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>the knot<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cankem80@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"76.253.50.168","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1407523557,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279372.png?_r=1436816059","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":209,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cankem80","Id":279372,"Name":"cankem80","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"122.15.103.61","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75396,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3cfd4d82a566e53d2af429a9f35d80ce","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Go with knot.com it is good&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1896745,"PostDate":1432190085,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Go with knot.com it is good<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katherineriverace@gmail.com","IpAddress":"122.15.103.61","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1425086317,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282278.png?_r=1425103909","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":242,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RitvikSehgal","Id":282278,"Name":"RitvikSehgal","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75396,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ffa4e6f9de7bff3b10aa361e5d61d6cb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I used Wedding Wire. &amp;nbsp;Really nice templates and easy to use.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1896776,"PostDate":1432212990,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I used Wedding Wire. \u00a0Really nice templates and easy to use.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><img src=\"http:\/\/\" alt=\"\"><\/div>\n<div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;32;116\/st\/20160430\/e\/we+say+I+do%21\/k\/8afc\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread:<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529<\/a>","Email":"deannaproteau@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1421428169,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1442083173","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"deecol","Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.147.121.183","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75396,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"34113b2bd961b05c0f897206b3bc71e7","RawContent":"I started with mywedding.com and ended up using weddingwire.com. \n\n\nI still have no colour scheme and am not sure I want anything other than neutral colours with maybe a pop of sparkle. Finding a specific colour scheme to match was not necessary (obviously) but I was able to find one with a calligraphy font I loved that matched our save the dates. \n\n\nI caution you to make your site name as short as possible. We had a longer one that didn&#039;t fit well in most STDs. Of coarse you could pay for your domain too if that&#039;s important to you. We decided to keep the $50-$60 and spend it on other (likely unnecessary) things lol","Attachments":[],"Id":1896846,"PostDate":1432260665,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I started with mywedding.com and ended up using weddingwire.com. <br><br>\nI still have no colour scheme and am not sure I want anything other than neutral colours with maybe a pop of sparkle. Finding a specific colour scheme to match was not necessary (obviously) but I was able to find one with a calligraphy font I loved that matched our save the dates. <br><br>\nI caution you to make your site name as short as possible. We had a longer one that didn't fit well in most STDs. Of coarse you could pay for your domain too if that's important to you. We decided to keep the $50-$60 and spend it on other (likely unnecessary) things lol\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My Planning Thread: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79377-ashhtayys-planning-thread-azul-fives-june-7-2016\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79377-ashhtayys-planning-thread-azul-fives-june-7-2016\/<\/a><br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;0;116\/st\/20160607\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/1\/k\/bb99\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>","Email":"ashley.taylor@live.ca","IpAddress":"184.147.135.4","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1423090661,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282006.png?_r=1423373502","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":138,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ashhtayy","Id":282006,"Name":"ashhtayy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"122.165.88.94","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75396,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2fcfdeb863c516094f5fe574e714b72c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt