2576a641711752","RawContent":"I love theknot.com task list feature!","Attachments":[],"Id":214954,"PostDate":1204579760,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I love theknot.com task list feature!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yari2566@mac.com","IpAddress":"173.60.223.125","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1188371880,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207684.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Yari","Id":207684,"Name":"Yari","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":12263,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e5b27c198508aac380649e908944c46c","RawContent":"Figures....theknot.com is the one I haven&#039;t tried using just yet...but I will give it a shot!\n \n Thanks everyone!","Attachments":[],"Id":215019,"PostDate":1204582460,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Figures....theknot.com is the one I haven't tried using just yet...but I will give it a shot!<br \/> <br \/> Thanks everyone!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/image.lafemmebonita.com\/c\/a741121.png\">http:\/\/image.lafemmebonita.com\/c\/a741121.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"aimless911@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1204119567,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208670.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":75,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Aimless911","Id":208670,"Name":"Aimless911","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":12263,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e7bf3a335dd42745bbc28fefb00c9be2","RawContent":"I&#039;ve been using &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.ezweddingplanner.com\"&gt;Wedding Planner - Free online planning software&lt;\/a&gt;. It looks like it&#039;s straight outta the &#039;80s, but I love the &amp;quot;People&amp;quot; feature and the &amp;quot;Seating&amp;quot; one too. I don&#039;t really use it for much else, as it&#039;s not highly customizeable (sp?) but you can change SOME things.","Attachments":[],"Id":215025,"PostDate":1204583093,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I've been using <a href='http:\/\/www.ezweddingplanner.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Wedding Planner - Free online planning software<\/a>. It looks like it's straight outta the '80s, but I love the \"People\" feature and the \"Seating\" one too. I don't really use it for much else, as it's not highly customizeable (sp?) but you can change SOME things.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"abbie.chalcraft@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"166.147.88.43","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1194472440,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207912.jpg?_r=1386394469","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":162,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Abbie","Id":207912,"Name":"Abbie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":12263,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"57d548dd84dee16b023b9ae0995402ba","RawContent":"I used the one from Sandals.com. I really like it and it&#039;s free. I think it would be great for what you want cause you can set up different events. \n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.sandals.com\/general\/planner.cfm\"&gt;Wedding Planner Software&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":270119,"PostDate":1208371811,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I used the one from Sandals.com. I really like it and it's free. I think it would be great for what you want cause you can set up different events. <br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.sandals.com\/general\/planner.cfm' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Wedding Planner Software<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10747;130\/st\/20090321\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/8eec\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...8eec\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jahaughton@rogers.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1206364373,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208899.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":71,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MarchBride","Id":208899,"Name":"MarchBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":12263,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aeac302691cefd6c425c94840d633f95","RawContent":"here&#039;s another thread about this, just for more input\n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t11096\"&gt;http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t11096&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n also keep in mind the reason why you are having a hard time making any of them work is that all the software and programs and wedding planning books are made for traditional weddings not DW&#039;s.","Attachments":[],"Id":270141,"PostDate":1208372549,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                here's another thread about this, just for more input<br \/> <a href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t11096' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/bestdestinati...om\/forum\/t11096<\/a><br \/> <br \/> also keep in mind the reason why you are having a hard time making any of them work is that all the software and programs and wedding planning books are made for traditional weddings not DW's.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<strong>Christine + Will (married 7\/20\/07) + Ainsleigh (born 6\/25\/08) + Nolan (born 11\/9\/10) + Delaney (born 12\/31\/13) = One Very Happy Family!<\/strong>","Email":"christine@dc-hulls.com","IpAddress":"167.154.70.240","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1165971180,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206965.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Christine","Id":206965,"Name":"Christine","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":16,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
