o a wedding video, but the more I talk to other brides that is the one thing they regret not getting. &amp;nbsp;So I have moved some of my budget around to include a wedding video. &amp;nbsp;I am booked with Sarani and she has amazing 5 minute video clips that I can&#039;t wait to get.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1868706,"PostDate":1408960290,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I orginially wasn't going to do a wedding video, but the more I talk to other brides that is the one thing they regret not getting. \u00a0So I have moved some of my budget around to include a wedding video. \u00a0I am booked with Sarani and she has amazing 5 minute video clips that I can't wait to get.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nicki7985@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"96.235.184.26","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1405886652,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279097.jpg?_r=1408764462","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"NickiLynn1116","Id":279097,"Name":"NickiLynn1116","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76028,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a8ad21c2c062493dc092e88e51743fe9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"NickiLynn1116\"] we weren&#039;t goin